<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios-March 7.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios-March 7.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
